Portions adapted from MailCraft and WordCraft

PlanCraft follows the architecture and conventions of MailCraft
(https://github.com/UCS-Care-Group/mailcraft) and WordCraft (https://github.com/storytold/wordcraft).
These parts started from their source, licensed under the MIT License or the Apache License,
Version 2.0:

- workspace tooling: xtask (layers, assets, wasm, ci), rustfmt and clippy settings, the lint set;
- the CI workflow (.github/workflows/ci.yml).
